-02T18:36:02Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-11-02T18:36:02Z"}, "message": "fix: Fix post process forwarder metric (#40821)\n\nSince this metric is a count, if the global SENTRY_METRICS setting is configured to anything other than 1 (which is the case at Sentry) this metric will be wrong.\r\n\r\nThis change now calls metrics.incr() with a sample rate of 1. Since we don't want to send too many metrics, we now buffer the counts and only flush them once per second.", "tree": {"sha": "e43fe69f918f2172086afcd8006eb1317e6877da", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/trees/e43fe69f918f2172086afcd8006eb1317e6877da"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/commits/0633e27b47a992643df195d373c022ad3c5fdd87", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjYriSCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAOU4IAFpZ7xXMCeXcQ6NVVmxOa1V+\nvquHP9jetX8WTVLBsaM9JIrp4Y7yaXsj81MpVi7e+jWV/7ZogJrlH9SWrUWOes7C\n3iuJY4r/yVBB02xerPr2/UR4l7mhn0H2hARrIICdeQva4/wZtbaS9zDspZiq+OIQ\nG2j+C6qgam3R1qjUcYaGlZcCoq6aRnVOah5kRrQi695fvLZ6BSfeYep+Rw22x94n\nOFOZc4iVzMi5pYXM3MD+hdkiCBZrzF7ix3yZorNxKs0xlt67cDEv3SssvKAQn0xt\nlsuAXGlG9jv0TEu64m6Xlheae0KPq24r/EAQ2A4AZ6uyQQF+COWYlgc+/jM6PKg=\n=sotJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree e43fe69f918f2172086afcd8006eb1317e6877da\nparent 43b71c18886d2b477e7fedc2eb827f54006b482c\nauthor Lyn Nagara <lyn.nagara@gmail.com> 1667414162 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1667414162 -0700\n\nfix: Fix post process forwarder metric (#40821)\n\nSince this metric is a count, if the global SENTRY_METRICS setting is configured to anything other than 1 (which is the case at Sentry) this metric will be wrong.\r\n\r\nThis change now calls metrics.incr() with a sample rate of 1. Since we don't want to send too many metrics, we now buffer the counts and only flush them once per second.", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:5